      "side": 1,
      "message": "Avoiding using formatted string in logging function.  See https://google.github.io/styleguide/pyguide.html#3101-logging\n```suggestion\n                        logging.info(\u0027%s calling connect_all_enabled_profiles\u0027, address)\n```",
